[ti:Persian Koobideh]
[length:3:08]
[00:01.02]Hey, everybody!
[00:02.96]You want the secret to Persian delight?
[00:05.74]Let’s make some Koobideh tonight!
[00:09.35]Get your skewers ready… fire up the grill!
[00:14.26]
[00:25.87]Two pounds of lamb, or beef with some fat,
[00:28.23]Three grated onions now how about that?
[00:30.46]Squeeze out the juice, don’t let it stay,
[00:32.82]We want that meat to hold its shape!
[00:34.90]Add salt and pepper, season it right,
[00:37.26]A little turmeric if you like the bite.
[00:39.62]Keep it simple, keep it real,
[00:41.70]That’s how you start a Persian meal!
[00:44.62]Mix it, mash it, work that meat,
[00:46.84]Knead it till the texture’s smooth and neat!
[00:49.06]Ten minutes strong, let the flavors unite,
[00:51.28]Cover and chill it let it rest overnight!
[00:56.00]Koo-bi-deh! Koo-bi-deh!
[00:57.39]Persian kebab is on the way!
[00:59.75]On the skewer, on the flame,
[01:02.11]Smoky, juicy, that’s the game!
[01:04.89]Koo-bi-deh! Koo-bi-deh!
[01:06.14]Turn it fast, don’t let it fall away!
[01:08.36]Rice and butter, sumac too,
[01:10.86]Persian barbecue is waiting for you!
[01:16.97]Wet your hands, now grab a ball,
[01:19.61]Press it gently, spread it tall.
[01:21.41]Place the meat on a flat metal skewer,
[01:23.64]Shape it evenly, make it smoother.
[01:25.86]Pinch the ridges with your thumb,
[01:27.94]Make those classic grooves become!
[01:30.30]Seal the edges, hold it tight,
[01:32.38]Keep that meat upon the skewer right!
[01:35.16]Get your charcoal glowing red,
[01:37.24]No big flames beneath the bread!
[01:39.46]Place the skewers, side by side,
[01:41.82]Turn them quickly, don’t let them slide.
[01:43.91]Flip them often at the start,
[01:46.41]That’s the secret, that’s the art!
[01:48.49]Cook till golden, juicy inside,
[01:50.57]No raw meat left when it’s time to dine!
[01:55.71]Grilled tomatoes, charred and sweet,
[01:57.93]Fresh herbs make the perfect treat.
[02:00.29]Saffron rice in golden light,
[02:02.37]Butter melting what a sight!
[02:04.60]Sprinkle sumac, squeeze some lime,
[02:06.82]Gather ‘round, it’s dinner time!
[02:08.76]From Tehran streets to lands afar,
[02:11.40]Persian Koobideh’s the barbecue star!
[02:15.98]Koo-bi-deh! Koo-bi-deh!
[02:17.23]Made with love the Persian way!
[02:19.73]Onions, meat, and charcoal heat,
[02:21.81]Nothing beats this smoky treat!
[02:25.01]Koo-bi-deh! Koo-bi-deh!
[02:25.98]Bring the family, shout hooray!
[02:28.62]Saffron rice and kebabs divine,
[02:30.84]Persian flavor, every time!
[02:35.42]Remember the rule, now here’s the key:
[02:38.20]Squeeze those onions, knead carefully!
[02:41.95]Keep turning till the meat is done…
[02:45.83]Persian Koobideh now that’s fun!
[02:50.32]
